@startuml
title UC-05 Collect Item Drops
actor Player
boundary "Game Frontend" as UI
control "Item Drop System" as Drops
database "Game / Inventory State" as State
UI -> Drops: Enemy defeated or event completed
Drops -> State: Read reward rules and item definitions
State --> Drops: Drop chances, items and rarities
alt Drop roll successful
 Drops -> State: Create item pickup
 Drops --> UI: Show dropped item
 UI --> Player: Display pickup with type / rarity
 Player -> UI: Collect item in pickup range
 UI -> Drops: Request pickup
 Drops -> State: Check pickup availability and item type
 State --> Drops: Valid pickup and item definition
 alt Persistent inventory item
  Drops -> State: Add exactly one item; remove pickup
  State --> Drops: Updated collected items
  Drops --> UI: Item name and rarity
  UI --> Player: Show pickup feedback
 else Temporary treat
  Drops -> State: Apply treat effect; remove pickup
  Drops --> UI: Effect feedback
  UI --> Player: Show active boost
 else Pickup already claimed
  Drops --> UI: Reject duplicate pickup
  UI --> Player: No item granted
 end
else No drop
 Drops --> UI: No item created
end
@enduml
